 EE.removeListener('another-event', emitted, context);
 ```
 
+### Collecting listener results
+
+Use `EventEmitter.emitCollect` when you need the synchronous return value from
+each listener. It returns the values in registration order and forwards event
+arguments using the same context rules as `emit`.
+
+```js
+var EE = new EventEmitter();
+
+EE.on('calculate', function (a, b) {
+  return a + b;
+});
+
+var results = EE.emitCollect('calculate', 2, 3); // [5]
+```
+
 ### Tests and benchmarks
 
 To run tests run `npm test`. To run the benchmarks run `npm run benchmark`.
